    "regime_notes": "Strong and positive across 2020-2025, 2026 onward, and 2028 onward; 2029 YTD is positive at 5D/10D but negative at 20D, so recent drift should be monitored conservatively. Cross-section is the full 15-instrument tradable universe.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_2_20290531_xs_acceleration_signal.csv",
